  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN-UK EIP Programme Funded Roles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is to cover the cost of Programme Insourced Role, for Economic Adviser (G7) and Assistant Economist (HEO) for EIP Programme based in Jakarta. These roles are responsible for overseeing the EIP programme&#x2019;s strategic direction, providing technical guidance to the delivery team, and coordinating with relevant divisions and sectoral bodies within the ASEAN Secretariat under the ASEAN Economic Community Pillar. Their work primarily focuses on delivery activities in the countries included in the Initiative for ASEAN Integration (IAI): Laos, Cambodia, and Timor-Leste. The costs covered including salary, deployment, L&amp;D and other associated costs with this role.</narrative>
  </description>
